  "text.autoconfig.fishofthieves.option.general.enableWormsAttachedFishingHook": "Enable Worms Attached to Fishing Hook",
  "text.autoconfig.fishofthieves.option.general.enableWormsAttachedFishingHook.@Tooltip[0]": "When casting fishing rod it will attached any worms to the fishing hook and consumed from your offhand or inventory.",
